# verification — DISAGREEMENT: model permits but AWS blocks

> **Not authoritative.** the engine and the reachability analyzer disagree: engine reports PERMITTED, reachability analyzer reports NOT REACHABLE — neither is preferred and neither is treated as correct, so the disagreement is reported rather than resolved, and one of the two is wrong about this flow

- flow: 10.0.1.10/32 -> 10.1.2.30/32 tcp/443
- engine: PERMITTED (7 hops evaluated, none blocked)
- reachability analyzer: NOT REACHABLE (analysis in ap-southeast-2 from eni-0123456789abcdef0 to eni-0abcdef123456789a)

